# Auto-activates the darktable dev shell when you cd into the checkout, and
# lets Doom's :tools direnv module hand the same environment to eglot/clangd.
#
# `use nix` works with plain direnv. If you have nix-direnv installed it will
# cache the shell, so replace the line below with `use flake` or keep `use nix`
# — nix-direnv hooks both.
use nix
